bluejetty:00036582:ios.description:
Plane tickets and Hotels app is your convenient and reliable assistant for searching for airline tickets. The application is created to make the process of searching and buying airline tickets as easy and comfortable as possible.
With us you can:
* easily and quickly find and sort airline tickets by price/quality ratio;
* find discounts from all airlines and alliances;
* find full flight schedules;
* see the updated sales calendar of cheap airfares every day;
* build optimal or composite routes;
* customize filters and sorting to get the best price offers;
* get information about baggage and hand luggage allowance;
* compare prices on popular websites;
Our app makes it easy to find and book airfare. Instead of manually browsing through many sites looking for discounts and bonuses, you can trust us. The app works with offers from online agencies, often offering prices lower than the air carriers themselves.
After searching:
* choose the appropriate airfare;
* go to the desired site;
* book or buy tickets.
Travel cheaper and more conveniently with us!

